package org.bibhuti.mvc;

Observer Pattern:
Observable class allows models to register and notify observers.
Observer interface defines the update() method, which is called when the model changes.
Both ContactList and Contact extend Observable so they can notify their respective observers (the views).
View as Observer:
AddContactActivity and EditContactActivity implement the Observer interface, meaning they will update when the model changes.
When a contact is added or edited, these views are notified and display the updated data.